        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a place where the dead refuse to rest. In <strong>Banished Souls</strong>, you take the role of a paranormal investigator tasked with uncovering the truth behind the haunting. Explore the chilling paranormal locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission</strong>: find the Room of Death, gather clues to reveal the three sinister symbols that uncover the ghost’s true nature. Once you’ve identified the ghost type, deploy your containment cube to trap the ghost and banish the entity from our world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware—the longer you stay, the more the ghost stalks you. Every decision is a risk, and every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth, or join the lost souls you came to banish?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All maps, ghost models, gear, and assets I've created specifically for <i>Banished Souls</i> and are unique to the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 pieces of gear help with your investigation. Earn money by banishing ghosts to unlock advanced gear or start as a broke ghost hunter with basic tools at your disposal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ghost Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 different ghost types, each with unique behaviors, keeping you on your toes and making every haunting unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play How You Want</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your challenge: You can play with 0, 1, 2, or 3 evidence, with varying difficulties to match your skill and strategy.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a place where the dead refuse to rest. In <strong>Banished Souls</strong>, you take the role of a paranormal investigator tasked with uncovering the truth behind the haunting. Explore the chilling paranormal locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission</strong>: find the Room of Death, gather clues to reveal the three sinister symbols that uncover the ghost’s true nature. Once you’ve identified the ghost type, deploy your containment cube to trap the ghost and banish the entity from our world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware—the longer you stay, the more the ghost stalks you. Every decision is a risk, and every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth, or join the lost souls you came to banish?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All maps, ghost models, gear, and assets I've created specifically for <i>Banished Souls</i> and are unique to the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 pieces of gear help with your investigation. Earn money by banishing ghosts to unlock advanced gear or start as a broke ghost hunter with basic tools at your disposal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ghost Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 different ghost types, each with unique behaviors, keeping you on your toes and making every haunting unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play How You Want</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your challenge: You can play with 0, 1, 2, or 3 evidence, with varying difficulties to match your skill and strategy.</p>",
        "short_description": "Banished Souls is a chilling paranormal investigation game where every haunting is unpredictable. Explore cursed relics, decipher deadly symbols, and uncover the Room of Death. Only by revealing the ghost’s true identity and banishing it can you survive.",
